==English==

===Noun===
{{head|en|noun}}

# {{acronym of|en|[[transfer]] of [[undertakings]]}} (Protection of Employment)

===Verb===
{{en-verb|TUPEs|TUPEing|TUPEd}}

# {{lb|en|British|colloquial}} To transfer (an employee or group of employees) to another employer under TUPE regulations.

====Usage notes====
* Most commonly encountered in the passive voice, e.g. "Following the outsourcing agreement, the IT department was TUPEd out to BigSys Corporation."

